# Poly(vinylidene fluoride), β (form I): R. Hasegawa, Y. Takahashi, Y. Chatani & H. Tadokoro, Polym. J. 3, 600 (1972), doi:10.1295/polymj.3.600
# space group Cm2m (c the chain axis) (No. 38), Z = 2 C2H2F2 per cell; cell p. 601; Table I(a) p. 603 (planar zigzag model, hydrogens included); density p. 604
# correction / model: F y/b = 0.335 instead of the printed 0.355 (Table I(a)): 0.355 gives C-F 1.40 A and F-C-F 101 deg against the paper's stated C-F 1.34 A and F-C-F 108 deg (p. 603), which give 0.335; the printed form III value (0.330) and the disordered model's F pair (mean 0.332) agree with 0.335
# correction / model: the ordered planar zigzag model (a), not the statistical +-7 deg model (b)
# hydrogens: the paper's
# written in P1 with every atom of the paper's cell; 1.9719 g/cm3, shortest contacts beyond 1-3: H...H 2.56 A, H...X 2.60 A, X...X 2.56 A
